          "imageUrl": "https://musicfile.kie.ai/NTk5MzJlMjEtYmE2YS00Y2YyLTg1MGYtMzcyYTlmYzFlYjg0.jpeg",
          "title": "Crown of Ashes",
          "tags": "Epic orchestral cinematic, sweeping string ostinato and broad legato violins, bold French horns and low brass, deep orchestral percussion with driving taiko and timpani, retain a dark-pop pulse through restrained synth bass and modern kick, intimate low male lead rising into expressive falsetto on the hooks, dramatic builds from sparse verse to towering chorus, wide polished film-score mix with clear vocal center and powerful final outro. Original English song, dark minor key, 88 BPM, around 3:30. Distinctive warm gritty baritone, textured husky rasp, resonant chest voice, natural breath and slight vocal cracks, emotionally varied phrasing, light vibrato. Falsetto retains an airy human texture; no screaming, robotic tuning or harsh distortion. Intro: low cello pulse and distant horn, then strings unfold. Defiant renewal after personal loss. Quiet bridge before immense final chorus, orchestral outro resolving with lingering low strings."
        }
      ],
      "error": null,
